  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e58bee9b4c46a224c80d4cfa351830c1, type: 3}
  m_Name: Mannekin Conversation
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialougeText
  npcName: Mannequin
  paragraphs:
  - Oh... You are that new kid everyone has been talking about.
  - 'Not that i care or anything but there was some people who took your erhm, body
    parts... '
  - 'I think they dropped your leg while they were running so it shouldn''t be that
    far from here. '
  - 'Just remember that they do not like the thought of being replaced. '
  - 'So if you get to close too them. '
  - 'Be ready for a fight. '
